From b5eb06b877386f2db7dd83e64c79c166cc34fa54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brandon <bjmuzila@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 18:57:07 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Vela audit fixes (2026-10-07): 1D/1W wrong ticker, payload
 sizes, loading states
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- /api/vela/history implemented (explicit index/futures map, daily adapter);
  /api/lse/resolve exact-only, indexes never name-matched; client skips the
  vault for indexes and drops long history that does not price like the tape
- /api/chains: stale-while-revalidate cache for live=0, opt-in front=1/slim=1
- option-strike-gex-history: opt-in compact fmt=c (~1/15 the bytes)
- /api/page-preset?pages= batch; Vela reads its 10 pages in one request
- Scripts editor + Strategy Tester/Alerts load on first open
- etf-candles: days= counts sessions; post-close flat bars not written/read
- Legend "Loading levels…" + empty-read retries; D/W/M load timeouts + toast

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
